2
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Reversible 風真いろは生誕LIVE 2025
Reversible: Kazama Iroha Birthday LIVE 2025

3
00:03:14,600 --> 00:03:15,400
皆さん！
Everyone!

4
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:18,200
風真いろは生誕LIVE2025、
Welcome to Kazama Iroha Birthday LIVE 2025!

5
00:03:18,200 --> 00:03:20,600
来てくださいましてありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming!

6
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:24,400
全力で楽しんでいってくださいね！
Please enjoy yourselves to the very fullest!

7
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,200
想像なんてしてなかった
I never could have imagined this

8
00:03:31,200 --> 00:03:34,800
現状 君もそう思った？
The present state... did you think so too?

9
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:38,200
最高で止まらないように
So we don't stop at our best,

10
00:03:38,200 --> 00:03:41,200
更新したい
I want to keep updating it.

11
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:45,300
叶えたい夢まであとどれくらい？
How much further until the dream I want to fulfill?

12
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:48,500
誰も行ったことがない場所へ
To a place where no one has ever been before,

13
00:03:48,500 --> 00:03:51,900
辿り着くまでは僕ら止まらない
until we reach it, we won't stop.

14
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:55,700
多分しんどいけど どうかよろしくね
It might be tough, but please look after me.

15
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,600
ねえねえ たまにメーデー
Hey, hey, sometimes it's a mayday,

16
00:03:57,600 --> 00:03:59,800
僕だけじゃ作れないもの
something I can't create all on my own.

17
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,300
僕とか君とかあたしとか
Whether it's me, you, or myself,

18
00:04:01,300 --> 00:04:02,800
恋とか愛とかまとめて全部
romance or love, bringing it all together...

19
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:06,800
君を置いてどこかに行っちゃうとか
Leaving you behind to go somewhere else...

20
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,500
ありえないよ
That's just impossible!

21
00:04:09,100 --> 00:04:12,500
君がくれた音に 弾けた火花に
To the sound you gave me, to the bursting spark...

22
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:15,900
初めましてから ずっと恋しちゃってるんだよ
Ever since we first met, I've been in love with you.

23
00:04:15,900 --> 00:04:19,400
君のいない未来 考えらんないよ
I can't even imagine a future without you.

24
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:22,800
これから先も二人がいいじゃん
From now on too, it's best if we're together, right?

25
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:26,200
一途になるほど 逃げ出すものさよ
The more single-minded you get, the more it slips away.

26
00:04:26,200 --> 00:04:29,600
散々な僕のこと 呼んでくれてありがとう
Thank you for calling out to a disaster like me.

27
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:33,000
君のいない未来 考えらんないよ
I can't even imagine a future without you.

28
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:37,000
これから先も二人で そう、それがいいじゃん
From now on too, the two of us... Yes, that's best, right?

29
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:44,000
妄想 膨らんでくストーリー
Delusions, a swelling story,

30
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:47,400
感傷 やけに凹んじゃって
Sentimentality, feeling awfully down,

31
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:50,800
代償 求めすぎは嫌よ
Compensation, I hate demanding too much.

32
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:54,600
終わんない愛の連鎖 どうでしょう
How about an endless chain of love?

33
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,500
ねえねえ おいでメーデー
Hey, hey, come here, mayday,

34
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,700
僕が君にできること
what I can do for you...

35
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:00,000
まだまだまだまだあるけど
There's still so, so, so, so much more...

36
00:05:00,048 --> 00:05:01,848
聴かせたいからじゃないんだ
It's not because I want you to listen to it,

37
00:05:01,848 --> 00:05:05,148
君の「愛」がいつも勝っちゃうこと
it's because your "love" always wins.

38
00:05:05,148 --> 00:05:07,748
許さないよ
I won't forgive you!

39
00:05:07,748 --> 00:05:10,548
おーいえい
Oh yeah!

40
00:05:22,048 --> 00:05:25,048
君以外はヤダ
Anyone but you is a no-no!

41
00:05:25,048 --> 00:05:29,548
わがままはただ
My selfish wish is just...

42
00:05:29,548 --> 00:05:35,548
「変わらないときめき」を提供しちゃうのはバカ？
...is it foolish of me to provide you with "unchanging excitement"?

43
00:05:36,548 --> 00:05:40,548
君がくれた音に 弾けた火花に
With the sound you gave me, and the sparks that flew,

44
00:05:40,548 --> 00:05:44,548
はじめましてから ずっと恋しちゃってるんだよ
I've been in love with you ever since we first met.

45
00:05:44,548 --> 00:05:48,048
君のいない未来 考えられないよ
I can't imagine a future without you!

46
00:05:48,048 --> 00:05:51,348
これから先も二人がいいじゃん
It's better if we're together from now on, right?

47
00:05:51,348 --> 00:05:54,848
道連れになるほど 逃げたくもなったよ
At times I wanted to escape so much that I'd drag you with me.

48
00:05:54,848 --> 00:05:58,348
散々な僕のこと 呼んでくれてありがとう
Thank you for calling out to a miserable person like me.

49
00:05:58,348 --> 00:06:01,848
君のいない未来 考えられないよ
I can't imagine a future without you!

50
00:06:01,848 --> 00:06:05,148
これから先も二人で そう、それがいいじゃん
It's better if we're together from now on, yes, that's just perfect!

51
00:06:51,548 --> 00:06:57,848
はい！というわけで、皆の衆！こんいろはでござるー！
Yes! So, everyone! Kon-Iroha-de-gozaru!

52
00:06:57,848 --> 00:07:06,048
ホロライブ6期生、つよつよかっこいいござるサムライ、風真いろはでござるー！
Hololive 6th Gen, the super-strong, cool gozaru samurai, Kazama Iroha here!

53
00:07:06,048 --> 00:07:16,848
はい！今年の誕生日1発目は、DECO*27さんの愛言葉シリーズ、4！愛言葉Ⅳを歌って踊らせていただきましたー！
Yes! For the first song of this year's birthday celebration, I sang and danced to DECO*27-san's 'Ai Kotoba' series, 4! 'Ai Kotoba IV'!

54
00:07:16,848 --> 00:07:24,548
拍手いっぱい来てる！みんなありがとう！ギフトとかスパチャもありがとうございます！
So many claps are coming in! Thank you, everyone! Thank you for the gifts and Super Chats as well!

55
